test.yaml:5:9: contains() with the string literal "refs/heads/main refs/heads/develop" as its first argument is true for any substring of it, not only for its words. to check membership in a list pass an array instead, e.g. contains(fromJSON('["a", "b"]'), value), or compare each value with == [unsound-contains]
test.yaml:8:17: contains() with the string literal "main develop" as its first argument is true for any substring of it, not only for its words. to check membership in a list pass an array instead, e.g. contains(fromJSON('["a", "b"]'), value), or compare each value with == [unsound-contains]
